I recently encountered this unfortunate problem with a low level Samuri in a
level 2 shop just
after killing a floating eye:

	You see here a floating eye corpse.
	>eat
	There is a floating eye corpse here; eat it?
	>yes
	Blecch!  Rotten food!  The world spins and goes dark.
	You are conscious again.
	>eat
	There is a partly eaten floating eye corpse here; eat it?
	>yes
	You resume your meal.
	You finish eating the floating eye corpse.
	You feel a strange mental acuity.
	The corpse will cost you 644245068 zorkmids.
	>pay
	You don't have gold enough to pay for a partly eaten floating eye corpse.

Since when does a corpse cost 6 hundred million.  Seems like a bug to me.

My only way out was to try to kill the Shop keeper.  Needless to say I was
unsuccessful.

Any thoughts on this.

